WEBVTT

00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:32.018
But what if unlikely allies
led out in front of issues?

00:05:32.042 --> 00:05:33.393
Like ...

00:05:33.417 --> 00:05:37.417
what if Black and Native American people
stood in front of immigration issues?

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.917
(Applause)

00:05:42.208 --> 00:05:46.643
Or what if white people led the charge

00:05:46.667 --> 00:05:48.684
to end racism?

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:52.708
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:53.625 --> 00:05:54.976
Or ...

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:59.476
what if men led the charge
on pay equity for women?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:03.476
(Applause and cheers)